al; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">山に囲まれていて自然豊かでしたー！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">癒されました</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">おにぎり頂いたんですけどお米が美味しすぎました〜</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">ごちそうさまでした</span><span class=\"s3\">🍙</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">君しか勝たんで手拍子してる人がたくさん見えて嬉しかったです</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0